# PHASE 2 — AWS Infrastructure Manual Setup

## 🎯 Phase 2 Goal

At the end of Phase 2, you should have this foundation:

```text
                         INTERNET
                             │
                    ┌────────▼────────┐
                    │       ALB       │
                    │  Public Subnet  │
                    └────────┬────────┘
                             │
                    ┌────────▼────────┐
                    │ ECS Fargate     │
                    │ Private Subnet  │
                    └────────┬────────┘
                             │
                       later phase
                             │
                    ┌────────▼────────┐
                    │ RDS PostgreSQL  │
                    │ Private Subnet  │
                    └─────────────────┘
```

