# PART 9 — Create Security Groups

Create three Security Groups:

```text
ALB SG
   ↓
ECS SG
   ↓
RDS SG
```

## SG 1 — ALB Security Group

Name:

```text
dev-alb-sg
```

Inbound:

```text
HTTP
Port: 80
Source: 0.0.0.0/0
```

Later:

```text
HTTPS
Port: 443
Source: 0.0.0.0/0
```

Outbound:

```text
All traffic
```

## SG 2 — ECS Security Group

Name:

```text
dev-ecs-sg
```

Inbound:

```text
Custom TCP
Application Port
Source:
dev-alb-sg
```

For example:

```text
Port 4000
Source: dev-alb-sg
```

Do NOT allow:

```text
0.0.0.0/0
```

## SG 3 — RDS Security Group

Name:

```text
dev-rds-sg
```

Inbound:

```text
PostgreSQL
Port: 5432
Source: dev-ecs-sg
```

Never use:

```text
5432 ← 0.0.0.0/0
```

Final security chain:

```text
Internet
   │
   │ 80/443
   ▼
ALB SG
   │
   │ Application Port
   ▼
ECS SG
   │
   │ 5432
   ▼
RDS SG
```

