# PART 37 — What You Should Understand Before Moving On

You should be able to explain:

### 1. Why VPC?

```text
Logical AWS network
```

### 2. Why public subnet?

```text
ALB / internet-facing resources
```

### 3. Why private subnet?

```text
ECS / RDS isolation
```

### 4. Why Internet Gateway?

```text
VPC ↔ Internet
```

### 5. Why NAT Gateway?

```text
Private resources → outbound internet
```

### 6. Why Security Groups?

```text
Control network access
```

### 7. Why ECR?

```text
Store Docker images
```

### 8. Why ECS?

```text
Run containers
```

### 9. Why Fargate?

```text
Run containers without managing EC2 servers
```

### 10. Why ALB?

```text
Public entry point + routing
```

### 11. Why Target Group?

```text
Define/register application targets behind ALB
```

### 12. Why CloudWatch?

```text
Centralized application/container logs
```

